ustomer-review" data-review-item data-review-order="0" data-rating="4" data-size="S" data-fit="false"><div class="dn-review-card-head"><p class="dn-review-author"><strong>Ben G.</strong> · S<span class="dn-review-verified">Verified purchase</span></p><span class="dn-review-stars" aria-label="4 out of 5 stars">★★★★☆</span></div><h4>The side view wins</h4><p>The little coat and boots are brilliant. Took a couple of attempts to get a picture that showed the rider properly, because straight on you mostly see our cat. Lovely once we found the angle.</p><details class="dn-review-conversation"><summary>The Dog Nook’s reply</summary><div class="dn-review-reply"><strong>The Dog Nook</strong><p>Ben, thanks for mentioning that. A slight side view gives the little coat and boots their moment too.</p></div></details></article><article class="dn-customer-review" data-review-item data-review-order="1" data-rating="4" data-size="M" data-fit="false"><div class="dn-review-card-head"><p class="dn-review-author"><strong>Chloe N.</strong> · M<span class="dn-review-verified">Verified purchase</span></p><span class="dn-review-stars" aria-label="4 out of 5 stars">★★★★☆</span></div><h4>Nice little light</h4><p>The pumpkin light is a sweet detail. It's less obvious in our bright kitchen than it is in the sitting room, so that's where we took our picture. Happy with it overall.</p></article><article class="dn-customer-review" data-review-item data-review-order="2" data-rating="5" data-size="S" data-fit="false"><div class="dn-review-card-head"><p class="dn-review-author"><strong>Dylan U.</strong> · S<span class="dn-review-verified">Verified purchase</span></p><span class="dn-review-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span></div><h4>No hat on the cat</h4><p>Our cat's face is completely visible, which is what I wanted. His normal expression with that tiny rider behind him is very funny.</p></article><article class="dn-customer-review" data-review-item data-review-order="3" data-rating="5" data-size="M" data-fit="true"><div class="dn-review-card-head"><p class="dn-review-author"><strong>Eve B.</strong> · M<span class="dn-review-verified">Verified purchase</span></p><span class="dn-review-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span></div><h4>M for ours</h4><p>Chose M after measuring rather than judging by all his fluff. It worked for our cat and the little horseman looks wonderfully daft on him.</p></article><article class="dn-customer-review" data-review-item data-review-order="4" data-rating="5" data-size="S" data-fit="false"><div class="dn-review-card-head"><p class="dn-review-author"><strong>Freddie I.</strong> · S<span class="dn-review-verified">Verified purchase</span></p><span class="dn-review-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span></div><h4>That tiny pumpkin</h4><p>The pumpkin is what made me choose this one. It gives the black rider a little bit of colour and looks lovely lit up in the photo.</p></article><article class="dn-customer-review" data-review-item data-review-order="5" data-rating="5" data-size="M" data-fit="false"><div class="dn-review-card-head"><p class="dn-review-author"><strong>Grace P.</strong> · M<span class="dn-review-verified">Verified purchase</span></p><span class="dn-review-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span></div><h4>One picture was enough</h4><p>Our cat gave us about a minute of cooperation. Got a lovely photo of the rider before he decided he had better things to do, so we took it off. Very much on his terms.</p><details class="dn-review-conversation"><summary>The Dog Nook’s reply</summary><div class="dn-review-reply"><strong>The Dog Nook</strong><p>Grace, it sounds like he made his schedule clear! Glad you got your picture and let him call time on the modelling.</p></div></details></article><article class="dn-customer-review" data-review-item data-review-order="6" data-rating="5" data-size="S" data-fit="false" hidden><div class="dn-review-card-head"><p class="dn-review-author"><strong>Ho