"dn-review-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span></div><h4>M and a serious expression</h4><p>Chose M for our cat. He looks like he has a very important job carrying that tiny rider, which is completely at odds with how silly the costume is.</p></article><article class="dn-customer-review" data-review-item data-review-order="48" data-rating="5" data-size="S" data-fit="false" hidden><div class="dn-review-card-head"><p class="dn-review-author"><strong>Kit C.</strong> · S<span class="dn-review-verified">Verified purchase</span></p><span class="dn-review-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span></div><h4>Glad I picked this theme</h4><p>Nearly bought another pair of wings. This is different enough that the new photo doesn't look like a repeat of last year's.</p></article><article class="dn-customer-review" data-review-item data-review-order="49" data-rating="5" data-size="M" data-fit="false" hidden><div class="dn-review-card-head"><p class="dn-review-author"><strong>Lou J.</strong> · M<span class="dn-review-verified">Verified purchase</span></p><span class="dn-review-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span></div><h4>My partner finally noticed</h4><p>Showed my partner the photo on my phone. He zoomed in, spotted the pumpkin and started laughing at the boots. Took him a moment to take it all in.</p><details class="dn-review-conversation"><summary>The Dog Nook’s reply</summary><div class="dn-review-reply"><strong>The Dog Nook</strong><p>Lou, there are a few little details to discover. Glad the pumpkin and boots got a laugh once he zoomed in.</p></div></details></article><article class="dn-customer-review" data-review-item data-review-order="50" data-rating="5" data-size="S" data-fit="true" hidden><div class="dn-review-card-head"><p class="dn-review-author"><strong>Morgan Q.</strong> · S<span class="dn-review-verified">Verified purchase</span></p><span class="dn-review-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span></div><h4>S fit our measurements</h4><p>We chose S using the size information. Pleased with it on our cat, though the picture is still mostly his enormous personality.</p></article><article class="dn-customer-review" data-review-item data-review-order="51" data-rating="3" data-size="S" data-fit="false" hidden><div class="dn-review-card-head"><p class="dn-review-author"><strong>Amelia W.</strong> · S<span class="dn-review-verified">Verified purchase</span></p><span class="dn-review-stars" aria-label="3 out of 5 stars">★★★☆☆</span></div><h4>Mark on the pumpkin</h4><p>The delivery bag was partly open and the little pumpkin had a scuff on it. The costume is very cute, but that mark was the first thing I noticed.</p><details class="dn-review-conversation"><summary>View conversation · 2 replies</summary><div class="dn-review-reply"><strong>The Dog Nook</strong><p>I'm sorry the pumpkin was scuffed, Amelia. We can replace the light-up costume at no extra cost. Please contact us privately with your order number so we can confirm the correct size.</p></div><div class="dn-review-reply"><strong>Amelia · Follow-up</strong><p>The new S arrived and the pumpkin is unmarked. Thanks for getting it sorted, I appreciate it.</p></div></details></article><article class="dn-customer-review" data-review-item data-review-order="52" data-rating="5" data-size="M" data-fit="false" hidden><div class="dn-review-card-head"><p class="dn-review-author"><strong>Nicky X.</strong> · M<span class="dn-review-verified">Verified purchase</span></p><span class="dn-review-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span></div><h4>The pumpkin is a nice touch</h4><p>The horseman would be funny by itself. The lit pumpkin adds something extra to the evening photo.</p></article><article class="dn-customer-review" data-review-item data-review-order="53" data-rating="5" data-size="S" data-fit="false" hidden><div class="dn-review-card-head"><p class="dn-review-author"><strong>Ollie E.</strong> · S<span class="dn-review-verified">Verified purchase</span></p><span class="dn-review-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span></div><h4>Got the whole rider in</h4><p>Stepped back rather than taking my usual close-up of the cat. Much better. You need to see the little coat and boots to get the joke.</p></article><article class="dn-customer-review" data-review-item data-review-order="54" data-rating="5" data-size="M" data-fit="true" hidden><div class="dn-review-card-head"><p class="dn-review-author"><strong>Pippa L.</strong> · M<span class="dn-review-verified">Verified purchase</span></p><span class="dn-review-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span></div><h4>For our family picture</h4><p>We wanted the cat included in one Halloween photo with us. The rider fits the theme nicely without hiding who he is.</p></article><article class="dn-customer-review" data-review-item data-review-order="55" data-rating="5" data-size="S" data-fit="false" hidden><div class="dn-review-card-head"><p class="dn-review-author"><strong>Quinn S.</strong> · S<span class="dn-review-verified">Verified purchase</span></p><span class="dn-review-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span></div><h4>A very patient model</h4><p>Our cat sat for a few pictures, then wandered off once we took it off. The tiny horseman looked much more dramatic than the whole event actually was.</p><details class="dn-review-conversation"><summary>The Dog Nook’s reply</summary><div class="dn-review-reply"><strong>The Dog Nook</strong><p>Quinn, a calm little photo session with a dramatic costume sounds like a good combination. Thanks for sharing it.</p></div></details></article><article class="dn-customer-review" data-review-item data-review-order="56" data-rating="5" data-size="M" data-fit="true" hidden><div class="dn-review-card-head"><p class="dn-review-author"><strong>Rae Z.</strong> · M<span class="dn-review-verified">Verified purchase</span></p><span class="dn-review-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span></div><h4>The dark rider stands out</h4><p>M suited our cat after measuring. The black figure shows up clearly against his pale coat, which was a nice bonus.</p></article><article class="dn-customer-review" data-review-item data-review-order="57" data-rating="5" data-size="S" data-fit="false" hidden><div class="dn-review-card-head"><p class="dn-review-author"><strong>Sam G.</strong> · S<span class="dn-review-verified">Verified purchase</span></p><span class="dn-review-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span></div><h4>More detail than a silhouette</h4><p>I like being able to see a coat, boots and a pumpkin rather than just a black shape. Makes the little rider more amusing.</p></article><article class="dn-customer-review" data-review-item data-review-order="58" data-rating="5" data-size="M" data-fit="false" hidden><div class="dn-review-card-head"><p class="dn-review-author"><strong>Taylor N.</strong> · M<span class="dn-review-verified">Verified purchase</span></p><span class="dn-review-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span></div><h4>Keeping the side view</h4><p>We've picked the side-on picture for the fridge. You can see both the glowing pumpkin and our cat's completely normal face.</p></article><article class="dn-customer-review" data-review-item data-review-order="59" data-rating="5" data-size="S" data-fit="false" hidden><div class="dn-review-card-head"><p class="dn-review-author"><strong>Uma U.</strong> · S<span class="dn-review-verified">Verified purchase</span></p><span class="dn-review-stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</span></div><h4>Silly and charming</h4><p>A cat carrying a headless horseman shouldn't be cute, but ours somehow manages it. Very happy with that photograph.</p></article></div><p data-review-status role="status">Showing 6 of 60 reviews</p><button type="button" class="dn-load-reviews" data-review-more>Load more reviews</button></section>{% endif %}
